{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e11-scene-12",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "隆重介绍一下我的男朋友  (Allow Me to Introduce My Boyfriend)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wen_simo": "闻思默",
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美",
    "bianbian": "边边"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the packed live press conference launching Twelve Singers Season Three, host Wen Simo welcomes the Golden Class onstage—and Xin Huimei steps forward before the cameras to answer the secret-marriage rumors herself. Listen to Wen Simo, Xin Huimei, and Bianbian in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "现场的各位媒体同仁，以及收看直播的所有观众朋友们，大家好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "欢迎各位来到十二歌王第三季新闻发布会的现场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "请大家用最热烈的掌声，有请黄金一班和中国天后辛惠美！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "十二歌王第三季将于下个月重新启幕，我们将融入全新的节目改版。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "各位媒体同仁，接下来可以自由提问了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "其实我知道大家想问的是什么。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "几天前我确实是单身，没有处在任何情感关系中，更没有结过婚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "但是现在已经不一样了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "那你男朋友是谁啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "现在我就要隆重介绍一下我的男朋友，星天娱乐的首席内容官，淳于乔先生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "爆炸性地公布了恋情，此前的隐婚传闻被证明为谣言。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "男友是被誉为天才制作人的淳于乔，出现在大众媒体的面前。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "现场的各位媒体同仁，以及收看直播的所有观众朋友们，大家好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To our media colleagues in the hall and all viewers watching the live broadcast, hello everyone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "欢迎各位来到十二歌王第三季新闻发布会的现场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Welcome to the official press conference for Season Three of Twelve Singers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "请大家用最热烈的掌声，有请黄金一班和中国天后辛惠美！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With your warmest applause, please welcome the Golden Class alongside pop diva Xin Huimei!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "十二歌王第三季将于下个月重新启幕，我们将融入全新的节目改版。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Season Three of Twelve Singers premieres next month, featuring a brand-new revamped competition format.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "各位媒体同仁，接下来可以自由提问了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Members of the press, the floor is now open for your questions.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "其实我知道大家想问的是什么。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Actually, I already know what everyone in the room wants to ask.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "几天前我确实是单身，没有处在任何情感关系中，更没有结过婚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Up until a few days ago I really was single — not in any relationship, and certainly never married.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "但是现在已经不一样了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today, however, things have changed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "那你男朋友是谁啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then who is your boyfriend?!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "现在我就要隆重介绍一下我的男朋友，星天娱乐的首席内容官，淳于乔先生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Allow me to proudly introduce my boyfriend — Xingtian Entertainment's chief content officer, Mr Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "爆炸性地公布了恋情，此前的隐婚传闻被证明为谣言。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With this bombshell romance announcement, the earlier secret-marriage rumors have been proven false.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "男友是被誉为天才制作人的淳于乔，出现在大众媒体的面前。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Her boyfriend is none other than genius producer Chun Yuqiao, stepping before the public media together.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "现场的各位媒体同仁，以及收看直播的所有观众朋友们，大家好。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "欢迎各位来到十二歌王第三季新闻发布会的现场。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "请大家用最热烈的掌声，有请黄金一班和中国天后辛惠美！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "十二歌王第三季将于下个月重新启幕，我们将融入全新的节目改版。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "各位媒体同仁，接下来可以自由提问了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "其实我知道大家想问的是什么。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "几天前我确实是单身，没有处在任何情感关系中，更没有结过婚。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "但是现在已经不一样了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "那你男朋友是谁啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "现在我就要隆重介绍一下我的男朋友，星天娱乐的首席内容官，淳于乔先生。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "爆炸性地公布了恋情，此前的隐婚传闻被证明为谣言。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "男友是被誉为天才制作人的淳于乔，出现在大众媒体的面前。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stunning every reporter in the hall, Xin Huimei introduces Chun Yuqiao onstage as her boyfriend, instantly sweeping away the hidden-marriage rumors across the media. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
